    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-401" contextRef="c-07">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); line-height: 14.98px"&gt;&lt;span lang="en-US" style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 15.6933px"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); line-height: 14.98px"&gt;&lt;span lang="en-US" style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 15.6933px"&gt;ConocoPhillips Transportation Alaska, Inc. (Company) is subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC). The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements generally conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); line-height: 14.98px"&gt;&lt;span lang="en-US" style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 15.6933px"&gt;Page 700 Not included with This Submission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); line-height: 14.98px"&gt;&lt;span lang="en-US" style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; line-height: 15.6933px"&gt;Page 700 is not included with this report as it is not required. Pipelines compromising the Trans-Alaska Pipeline System (TAPS) and any pipeline delivering oil directly to or indirectly into the TAPS are excluded from Page 700 reporting requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantNotesRegardingFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-403" contextRef="c-07">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" alt="download" width="428" height="203" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1745px; min-height: 0" /&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14.6667px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;The 2025 amount of Alyeska Non-Distance Related Costs (Location Code 9C) is $49.7 million.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14.6667px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14.6667px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;The 2025 amount of Alyeska Income Taxes on Imputed Management Fees is $2.1 million.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left; cursor: auto"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" alt="download (1)" width="714" height="597" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1745px; min-height: 0; width: 714px; height: 597px" /&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left; cursor: auto"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" alt="download (2)" width="558" height="418" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1745px; min-height: 0; width: 558px; height: 418px" /&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left; cursor: auto"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" alt="download (3)" width="567" height="462" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1745px; min-height: 0; width: 567px; height: 462px" /&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left; cursor: auto"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" alt="download (4)" width="559" height="406" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1745px; min-height: 0; width: 559px; height: 406px" /&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left; cursor: auto"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" alt="download (5)" width="563" height="412" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1745px; min-height: 0; width: 563px; height: 412px" /&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(73, 80, 87, 1); font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14.6667px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important; cursor: auto"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" alt="download (6)" width="562" height="505" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1745px; min-height: 0; width: 562px; height: 505px" /&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantNotesRegardingFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
